# Last Person to Fit in the Bus

## Problem Summary

Write a query to find the last person who can board the bus without the total weight exceeding 1000 kg.

## Solution

```sql
select person_name from (select person_name, turn, sum(weight) over (order by turn) as total_weight from queue)as q 
where total_weight <= 1000 order by turn desc limit 1;
```
